OL,3,GNEWSAThousands in Derry for 40th
OL,4,AHalloween festival finale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are in Londonderry
OL,7,Ffor the grand finale of the city's 40th
OL,8,Fanniversary Halloween festival,
OL,9,Fculminating in a carnival parade and
OL,10,Ffireworks display.
OL,12,FOrganisers have said the event has gone
OL,13,Ffrom humble beginnings during the
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland Troubles in the 1980s
OL,15,Fto Europe's largest Halloween festival.
OL,17,FThis year, Derry celebrates four
OL,18,Fdecades of the festival with events
OL,19,Finspired by folklore, mythology and the
OL,20,Ftraditions of Samhain, the ancient
OL,21,Ffestival in which Halloween's roots
OL,22,Flie.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
